    <item>
      <title>School Choices &amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County</title>
      <link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/schools-education-pathways/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;School Choices &amp;amp; Education Pathways in Anne Arundel County&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;school-choices--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#school-choices--education-pathways-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Understanding Anne Arundel County Public Schools (AACPS)&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;understanding-anne-arundel-county-public-schools-aacps&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#understanding-anne-arundel-county-public-schools-aacps&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;District Overview&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;district-overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#district-overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anne Arundel County Public Schools&lt;/strong&gt; serves approximately 55,000+ students across 80+ schools. As one of Maryland&amp;rsquo;s largest and highest-performing districts, AACPS offers diverse educational options for students from kindergarten through 12th grade.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Living in Parole, Maryland: Your Guide to Annapolis-Adjacent Suburban Life</title>
      <link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/parole-maryland-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/parole-maryland-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Welcome to Parole, Maryland&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;welcome-to-parole-maryland&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#welcome-to-parole-maryland&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 5 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Your First Look at Parole&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;your-first-look-at-parole&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#your-first-look-at-parole&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Parole is what happens when suburban development meets proximity to a historic capital city. Located right at the western edge of Annapolis, this Anne Arundel County community blends residential neighborhoods with major shopping centers, healthcare facilities, and easy access to both the city and the broader metropolitan region.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Anne Arundel County Parking Guide</title>
      <link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/parking-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/parking-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Anne Arundel County Parking Guide&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;anne-arundel-county-parking-guide&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#anne-arundel-county-parking-guide&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Parking in Anne Arundel County varies significantly depending on where you are. Downtown Annapolis has strict rules and paid parking. Suburban areas like Crofton and Odenton mostly offer free parking at businesses and homes.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Annapolis Parking&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;annapolis-parking&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#annapolis-parking&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Downtown Annapolis&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;downtown-annapolis&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#downtown-annapolis&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Downtown Annapolis has the most restrictive parking in the county. This is historic district with limited space and high demand.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
